WEBVTT

00:05:58.916 --> 00:06:00.836
where we look for diverse bodies.

00:06:01.196 --> 00:06:02.356
For instance,

00:06:02.356 --> 00:06:05.956
sports events are major stages
where bodies are on display

00:06:06.716 --> 00:06:09.356
Rather than uniformly thin or lean,

00:06:09.356 --> 00:06:13.076
different proportions, sizes
and abilities can be seen

00:06:13.076 --> 00:06:14.996
in the bodies of Olympians,

00:06:14.996 --> 00:06:16.036
Paralympians

00:06:16.036 --> 00:06:17.076
and other athletes.

00:06:17.556 --> 00:06:18.996
Beyond athletes,

00:06:18.996 --> 00:06:21.916
ad campaigns for clothing
or cosmetics

00:06:21.916 --> 00:06:25.196
may also feature a range
of ordinary consumers

00:06:25.196 --> 00:06:28.316
to represent their brand
as accessible and inclusive.

00:06:29.156 --> 00:06:31.596
These approaches are helpful correctives